        "text": "Search this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nAmanda Alysia for District 2\n# Amanda Alysia Daniels\n### Candidate for Hayward Area Recreation & Park District Board, Area 2\nSafe, Clean & Accessible Community Parks\nElection Day: November 3, 2026\nWelcome! I'm Amanda Alysia Daniels, a law student, analyst, and lifelong East Bay resident dedicated to keeping our parks safe, clean, and welcoming for everyone. My campaign for the Hayward Area Recreation & Park District Board, Area 2, is rooted in practical, community-focused solutions that reflect the voices of District 2 residents.\nMy vision for District 2 centers on safety, accessibility, and transparency. Learn more about my community priorities and practical solutions below.\nSpread the Word: Let your friends and neighbors know about Amanda's vision for District 2.\nExplore My Community Vision\nAbout Amanda\nSee Key Priorities\nSupport Our Vision\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse",
